             <label>Expansion</label>
         </rules>
     </decisions>
-    <description>When parent Billing Country is blank on deals-won, stamp it from ZoomInfo Country or Company Country when available and post an auto-filled note to #revops-issues; only page Missing HQ Country when no enrichment country exists. 130326 - removed David from country audit notification. Added emojis to make it easier to distinguish between renewal and new arr</description>
